    <!-- Disclaimers. Deliberately never "legally owed", "guaranteed" or "exact". -->
    <string name="leave_disclaimer">ElmTrackr provides estimates based on the workplace settings and the information you enter. Actual leave entitlement, balance and payment may differ based on your employment agreement, collective arrangements, payslip data and applicable law.</string>
    <string name="leave_balance_disclaimer">Estimated balance is based on the latest balance you entered and the leave reported in ElmTrackr. It does not include new accruals or employer-side adjustments made after that date.</string>
    <string name="leave_preset_disclaimer">The Israel preset is a suggested starting point, not payroll or legal advice. Change any part of it to match your own arrangement.</string>

